{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-splitting-procedure.md","title":"无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-splitting-procedure","aliases":["20-df-splitting-procedure"],"display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","chapter":"12","section":"12.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）","source_printed_pages":[200],"source_pdf_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-function-tree]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-splitting-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-splitting-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,e\\in\\omega\">\\(j,e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=T_j\">\\(T=T_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_j,T_{j,s}\">\\(T_j,T_{j,s}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a> 的编码与阶段模拟；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho\\)</span> 采用有限 oracle 阶段模拟。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是本条以及调用本构造时一并固定的环境参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)\\)</span> 沿用此参数，不断言不同程序索引对同一外延 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 产生相同输出树。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" href=\"?note=a4daa2d7bdea73d3\" title=\"20-df-function-tree\">20-df-function-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" href=\"?note=5c8fcd5a2bc3a582\" title=\"20-df-e-splitting\">20-df-e-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>有序串对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\rho,\\tau)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\((\\rho,\\tau)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的投影与自然数配对编码上的投影按参数类型区分；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle m,n\\rangle\">\\(\\langle m,n\\rangle\\)</span> 仍使用原数值配对编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\n\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s):=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall v&lt;s\\ [E_{j,e}(\\nu,v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ [t_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\n\\land\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle=\\min E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)],\\\\\nS:=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e),\\qquad S(\\varnothing)\\downarrow=\\sigma,\\\\\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\downarrow=\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[S(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\quad(i&lt;2).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)&lt;s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\n\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s):=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall v&lt;s\\ [E_{j,e}(\\nu,v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ [t_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\n\\land\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle=\\min E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)],\\\\\nS:=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e),\\qquad S(\\varnothing)\\downarrow=\\sigma,\\\\\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\downarrow=\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[S(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\quad(i&lt;2).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\rho,\\qquad\\pi_1((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\tau\n\\quad(\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_0((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\rho,\\qquad\\pi_1((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\tau\n\\quad(\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定阶段的所有见证检查都有限可判定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是普通不定搜索，未找到见证时发散。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{j,e}\">\\(q_{j,e}\\)</span> 用该阶段非空有限见证集中的最小配对代码选择有序对；子节点由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0\">\\(i=0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1\">\\(i=1\\)</span> 的互斥分支取得。在部分组合中先等待父值，保证严格按域串长度递归；两兄弟由同一见证决定。程序无 oracle，只有索引、有限串和数参数。必须区分该阶段有限见证集与整个程序将来可能枚举的值域。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）；印刷页 200；PDF 第 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $j,e\\in\\omega$，$T=T_j$ 且 $\\operatorname{FTree}(T)$；$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)$。$T_j,T_{j,s}$ 采用 [[20-df-function-tree]] 的编码与阶段模拟；$\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho$ 采用有限 oracle 阶段模拟。$j$ 是本条以及调用本构造时一并固定的环境参数；$\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)$ 沿用此参数，不断言不同程序索引对同一外延 $T$ 产生相同输出树。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"j,e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"T=T_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTree}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T_j,T_{j,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"(\\rho,\\tau)\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle m,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho)<s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)<s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)<s\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)<s\n\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z<s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^\\rho(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s):=\\{\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle:\n\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\land R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nE_{j,e}(\\nu,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\land\\forall v<s\\ [E_{j,e}(\\nu,v)=\\varnothing],\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists s\\in\\omega\\ [t_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=s\n\\land\\langle\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)\\rangle=\\min E_{j,e}(\\nu,s)],\\\\\nS:=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e),\\qquad S(\\varnothing)\\downarrow=\\sigma,\\\\\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\downarrow=\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\\n[S(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land q_{j,e}(\\nu)\\downarrow=(\\rho,\\tau)\n\\land((i=0\\land\\eta=\\rho)\\lor(i=1\\land\\eta=\\tau))]\\quad(i<2).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_0((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\rho,\\qquad\\pi_1((\\rho,\\tau)):=\\tau\n\\quad(\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"q_{j,e}","display":false},{"tex":"i=0","display":false},{"tex":"i=1","display":false}],"bytes":3507,"backlinks":[{"id":"210dad0d9d959bef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]。"},{"id":"2e72efb02984d69c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]；see [[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]；see [[20-lem-minimality-tree]]。"},{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-restriction]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-totality]]；see [[20-lem-color-inheritance]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]] — 章 12；直接提供者 6 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["f2458da73bd8fe19","01d522a0b0df3738","4ef1aee16db6b308","8ba6597a854c206f","a4daa2d7bdea73d3","35073b74f84433b3","5c8fcd5a2bc3a582"]}